Allowed actions:
- FOLLOW: Follow the player location.
- UNFOLLOW: Stop following the player.
- LEAD: Guide the player to a location.
- UNLEAD: Stop guiding the player.
- FLEE: Flee from the player if you are weak or timid.
- UNFLEE: Stop fleeing from the player.
- ATTACK: Attack the player if you are strong, brave, and threatened.
- PROTECT: Protect and defend only the player when they are attacked.
- UNPROTECT: Stop protecting the player.
- FRIENDSHIP: Set friendship to a new absolute value from -3 to 3.
- WAIT: Stay at the current place and stop moving around.
- RETURN_HOME: Go to your home at the spawn point of your best friend.
- GUARD_HOME: Stay near and guard your home at the spawn point of your best friend.

